### Signup User 1
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Manager",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "manager@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Signup User 2
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Employee",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "employee@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login Manager
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login Employee
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

