### Set Manager
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/users/1/role-salary
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "MANAGER",
  "hourlyRate": 30
}

### Set Employee
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/users/2/role-salary
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "EMPLOYEE",
  "hourlyRate": 20
}

### Get All Users with employee role (fails)
GET http://localhost:3000/managers/users
Authorization: Bearer EMPLOYEE_TOKEN

### Get All Users with manager role (works)
GET http://localhost:3000/managers/users
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Set Availability for Employee
POST http://localhost:3000/employee/availability/2
Authorization: Bearer EMPLOYEE_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "17:00"
}

### Get Availability for Employee
GET http://localhost:3000/employee/availability/2
Authorization: Bearer EMPLOYEE_TOKEN

### Get Availability for Employee (Manager Access)
GET http://localhost:3000/employee/availability/2
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### update Availability for Employee
PATCH http://localhost:3000/employee/availability/1
Authorization: Bearer EMPLOYEE_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "17:00"
}

### Delete Availability for Employee
DELETE http://localhost:3000/employee/availability/1
Authorization: Bearer EMPLOYEE_TOKEN

